Description: Jana 'Jax' Miller
LongDescription: Jana 'Jax' Miller, Chief Technology Officer (CTO) of Bushido-ArmaTech (BAT), is a brilliant but deeply misanthropic engineer. Her harsh upbringing and disdain for humanity have fueled her relentless drive to advance military technology, believing it to be humanity’s only hope for survival. Jax is known for her cutting-edge innovations and unyielding commitment to pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.
